sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 2PC Coordinator
    participant R as Recovery
    participant O as order-db
    participant P as payment-db
    participant I as inventory-db

    C->>O: PREPARE TRANSACTION
    C->>P: PREPARE TRANSACTION
    C->>I: PREPARE TRANSACTION
